  unitName: Count Heinrich (EU)
  unitId: 710144
  unitNumber: 7061
  description: Count Heinrich, now the Slayer of Noblesse, has dedicated his entire
    life to find and slay his fellow Shapeshifters. His wife, Countess Jade of the
    Green Castle gifted him with a scar on his jowl during their wedding night when
    she tried to behead him. He survived the attack, but fled his home and dropped
    his Noblesse title to fully embrace his new life as a hunter. The scar is now
    a memento of his past.
  summonDesc: I hope we'll hunt together for long nights.
  fusionDesc: Blood of Noblesse in the air. Good Night!
  evoDesc: I was a Lord, Now they call me Count? But I let go of my titles for the
    hunt...
